lth.","exampleCn":"锻炼对健康有益。","category":"四级"},{"id":"en_076","word":"blame","phonetic":"/bleɪm/","meaning":"v./n. 责备；归咎","example":"Don't blame others for your mistakes.","exampleCn":"别把错误归咎于他人。","category":"四级"},{"id":"en_077","word":"blank","phonetic":"/blæŋk/","meaning":"adj. 空白的 n. 空白","example":"Fill in the blank spaces.","exampleCn":"填写空白处。","category":"四级"},{"id":"en_078","word":"brave","phonetic":"/breɪv/","meaning":"adj. 勇敢的","example":"He is a brave soldier.","exampleCn":"他是个勇敢的士兵。","category":"四级"},{"id":"en_079","word":"brief","phonetic":"/briːf/","meaning":"adj. 简短的","example":"He gave a brief speech.","exampleCn":"他作了简短的演讲。","category":"六级"},{"id":"en_080","word":"budget","phonetic":"/ˈbʌdʒɪt/","meaning":"n. 预算","example":"We must keep within budget.","exampleCn":"我们必须控制在预算内。","category":"六级"},{"id":"en_081","word":"burden","phonetic":"/ˈbɜːdn/","meaning":"n. 负担；重担","example":"The burden is too heavy.","exampleCn":"负担太重了。","category":"六级"},{"id":"en_082","word":"calculate","phonetic":"/ˈkælkjuleɪt/","meaning":"v. 计算；估计","example":"We calculated the cost carefully.","exampleCn":"我们仔细计算了成本。","category":"四级"},{"id":"en_083","word":"campaign","phonetic":"/kæmˈpeɪn/","meaning":"n. 运动；战役","example":"They launched a campaign.","exampleCn":"他们发起了一场运动。","category":"六级"},{"id":"en_084","word":"candidate","phonetic":"/ˈkændɪdət/","meaning":"n. 候选人；考生","example":"She is a strong candidate.","exampleCn":"她是位有力的候选人。","category":"六级"},{"id":"en_085","word":"capacity","phonetic":"/kəˈpæsəti/","meaning":"n. 容量；能力","example":"The hall has a capacity of 500.","exampleCn":"大厅容量为500人。","category":"考研"},{"id":"en_086","word":"career","phonetic":"/kəˈrɪə(r)/","meaning":"n. 职业；事业","example":"He has a successful career.","exampleCn":"他事业有成。","category":"四级"},{"id":"en_087","word":"category","phonetic":"/ˈkætəɡəri/","meaning":"n. 类别；种类","example":"Which category does it belong to?","exampleCn":"它属于哪一类？","category":"六级"},{"id":"en_088","word":"cause","phonetic":"/kɔːz/","meaning":"n. 原因 v. 导致","example":"What caused the accident?","exampleCn":"事故的原因是什么？","category":"四级"},{"id":"en_089","word":"cease","phonetic":"/siːs/","meaning":"v. 停止；终止","example":"The rain ceased at midnight.","exampleCn":"雨在午夜停了。","category":"考研"},{"id":"en_090","word":"challenge","phonetic":"/ˈtʃælɪndʒ/","meaning":"n./v. 挑战","example":"This is a real challenge.","exampleCn":"这是个真正的挑战。","category":"六级"},{"id":"en_091","word":"character","phonetic":"/ˈkærəktə(r)/","meaning":"n. 性格；角色；字符","example":"He has a strong character.","exampleCn":"他性格坚强。","category":"四级"},{"id":"en_092","word":"charge","phonetic":"/tʃɑːdʒ/","meaning":"v. 收费；充电 n. 费用","example":"There is no charge for delivery.","exampleCn":"送货不收费。","category":"四级"},{"id":"en_093","word":"choose","phonetic":"/tʃuːz/","meaning":"v. 选择","example":"Choose the best answer.","exampleCn":"选择最佳答案。","category":"四级"},{"id":"en_094","word":"circle","phonetic":"/ˈsɜːkl/","meaning":"n. 圆圈；圈子","example":"They sat in a circle.","exampleCn":"他们围成一圈坐着。","category":"四级"},{"id":"en_095","word":"circumstance","phonetic":"/ˈsɜːkəmstəns/","meaning":"n. 情况；环境","example":"Under no circumstances should you give up.","exampleCn":"无论如何你都不该放弃。","category":"考研"},{"id":"en_096","word":"claim","phonetic":"/kleɪm/","meaning":"v./n. 声称；索赔","example":"He claimed to be a doctor.","exampleCn":"他声称自己是医生。","category":"六级"},{"id":"en_097","word":"clarify","phonetic":"/ˈklærəfaɪ/","meaning":"v. 澄清；阐明","example":"Could you clarify your point?","exampleCn":"你能阐明你的观点吗？","category":"考研"},{"id":"en_098","word":"classic","phonetic":"/ˈklæsɪk/","meaning":"adj. 经典的 n. 经典作品","example":"This is a classic novel.","exampleCn":"这是一部经典小说。","category":"四级"},{"id":"en_099","word":"climate","phonetic":"/ˈklaɪmət/","meaning":"n. 气候","example":"The climate here is mild.","exampleCn":"这里气候温和。","category":"六级"},{"id":"en_100","word":"close","phonetic":"/kləʊz/","meaning":"v. 关闭 adj. 近的","example":"Please close the door.","exampleCn":"请关门。","category":"四级"},{"id":"en_101","word":"clue","phonetic":"/kluː/","meaning":"n. 线索","example":"The police found a useful clue.","exampleCn":"警方发现了一条有用的线索。","category":"四级"},{"id":"en_102","word":"coach","phonetic":"/kəʊtʃ/","meaning":"n. 教练；长途车 v. 训练","example":"He is our new coach.","exampleCn":"他是我们的新教练。","category":"四级"},{"id":"en_103","word":"collapse","phonetic":"/kəˈlæps/","meaning":"v./n. 倒塌；崩溃","example":"The building collapsed in the earthquake.","exampleCn":"建筑物在地震中倒塌。","category":"考研"},{"id":"en_104","word":"colleague","phonetic":"/ˈkɒliːɡ/","meaning":"n. 同事","example":"She is my colleague.","exampleCn":"她是我的同事。","category":"四级"},{"id":"en_105","word":"combine","phonetic":"/kəmˈbaɪn/","meaning":"v. 结合；联合","example":"We combined our efforts.","exampleCn":"我们齐心协力。","category":"六级"},{"id":"en_106","word":"comfort","phonetic":"/ˈkʌmfət/","meaning":"n. 舒适 v. 安慰","example":"He comforted the crying child.","exampleCn":"他安慰哭泣的孩子。","category":"四级"},{"id":"en_107","word":"command","phonetic":"/kəˈmɑːnd/","meaning":"v./n. 命令；掌握","example":"He commanded the army.","exampleCn":"他统率军队。","category":"六级"},{"id":"en_108","word":"comment","phonetic":"/ˈkɒment/","meaning":"n./v. 评论","example":"I have no comment to make.","exampleCn":"我无可奉告。","category":"四级"},{"id":"en_109","word":"commit","phonetic":"/kəˈmɪt/","meaning":"v. 承诺；犯（罪）","example":"She committed herself to the cause.","exampleCn":"她致力于这项事业。","category":"六级"},{"id":"en_110","word":"common","phonetic":"/ˈkɒmən/","meaning":"adj. 常见的；共同的","example":"This is a common problem.","exampleCn":"这是个常见问题。","category":"四级"},{"id":"en_111","word":"compare","phonetic":"/kəmˈpeə(r)/","meaning":"v. 比较","example":"Compare the two pictures.","exampleCn":"比较这两张图。","category":"四级"},{"id":"en_112","word":"compete","phonetic":"/kəmˈpiːt/","meaning":"v. 竞争；比赛","example":"We compete with other firms.","exampleCn":"我们与其他公司竞争。","category":"六级"},{"id":"en_113","word":"complain","phonetic":"/kəmˈpleɪn/","meaning":"v. 抱怨；投诉","example":"He complained about the noise.","exampleCn":"他抱怨噪音。","category":"四级"},{"id":"en_114","word":"complex","phonetic":"/ˈkɒmpleks/","meaning":"adj. 复杂的","example":"This is a complex issue.","exampleCn":"这是个复杂的问题。","category":"六级"},{"id":"en_115","word":"component","phonetic":"/kəmˈpəʊnənt/","meaning":"n. 组成部分；元件","example":"This is a key component.","exampleCn":"这是一个关键部件。","category":"考研"},{"id":"en_116","word":"compose","phonetic":"/kəmˈpəʊz/","meaning":"v. 组成；创作","example":"Water is composed of hydrogen and oxygen.","exampleCn":"水由氢和氧组成。","category":"六级"},{"id":"en_117","word":"concern","phonetic":"/kənˈsɜːn/","meaning":"n./v. 关心；担忧","example":"This concerns everyone.","exampleCn":"这事关乎每个人。","category":"六级"},{"id":"en_118","word":"conclude","phonetic":"/kənˈkluːd/","meaning":"v. 得出结论；结束","example":"We concluded that he was right.","exampleCn":"我们得出结论他是对的。","category":"六级"},{"id":"en_119","word":"condition","phonetic":"/kənˈdɪʃn/","meaning":"n. 条件；状况","example":"The car is in good condition.","exampleCn":"这辆车状况良好。","category":"四级"},{"id":"en_120","word":"conduct","phonetic":"/kənˈdʌkt/","meaning":"v. 进行；实施 n. 行为","example":"They conducted a survey.","exampleCn":"他们进行了一项调查。","category":"六级"},{"id":"en_121","word":"confidence","phonetic":"/ˈkɒnfɪdəns/","meaning":"n. 信心","example":"She has confidence in herself.","exampleCn":"她对自己有信心。","category":"六级"},{"id":"en_122","word":"confirm","phonetic":"/kənˈfɜːm/","meaning":"v. 确认；证实","example":"Please confirm your booking.","exampleCn":"请确认您的预订。","category":"四级"},{"id":"en_123","word":"conflict","phonetic":"/ˈkɒnflɪkt/","meaning":"n./v. 冲突；矛盾","example":"There is a conflict of interest.","exampleCn":"存在利益冲突。","category":"六级"},{"id":"en_124","word":"confuse","phonetic":"/kənˈfjuːz/","meaning":"v. 使困惑","example":"The question confused me.","exampleCn":"这个问题让我困惑。","category":"四级"},{"id":"en_125","word":"congratulate","phonetic":"/kənˈɡrætʃuleɪt/","meaning":"v. 祝贺","example":"I congratulate you on your success.","exampleCn":"我祝贺你的成功。","category":"四级"},{"id":"en_126","word":"connect","phonetic":"/kəˈnekt/","meaning":"v. 连接；联系","example":"This wire connects to the screen.","exampleCn":"这根线连接到屏幕。","category":"四级"},{"id":"en_127","word":"consequence","phonetic":"/ˈkɒnsɪkwəns/","meaning":"n. 后果；结果","example":"You must accept the consequences.","exampleCn":"你必须承担后果。","category":"六级"},{"id":"en_128","word":"consider","phonetic":"/kənˈsɪdə(r)/","meaning":"v. 考虑；认为","example":"We consider him a friend.","exampleCn":"我们把他当朋友。","category":"四级"},{"id":"en_129","word":"consistent","phonetic":"/kənˈsɪstənt/","meaning":"adj. 一致的；始终如一的","example":"His story is consistent with the facts.","exampleCn":"他的说法与事实一致。","category":"考研"},{"id":"en_130","word":"constant","phonetic":"/ˈkɒnstənt/","meaning":"adj. 不断的；恒定的","example":"He is under constant pressure.","exampleCn":"他一直承受压力。","category":"六级"},{"id":"en_131","word":"construct","phonetic":"/kənˈstrʌkt/","meaning":"v. 建造；构造","example":"They constructed a new bridge.","exampleCn":"他们建了一座新桥。","category":"六级"},{"id":"en_132","word":"consult","phonetic":"/kənˈsʌlt/","meaning":"v. 咨询；查阅","example":"Consult a dictionary if unsure.","exampleCn":"不确定就查字典。","category":"六级"},{"id":"en_133","word":"consume","phonetic":"/kənˈsjuːm/","meaning":"v. 消耗；消费","example":"This car consumes a lot of fuel.","exampleCn":"这辆车油耗很高。","category":"六级"},{"id":"en_134","word":"contact","phonetic":"/ˈkɒntækt/","meaning":"n./v. 接触；联系","example":"Keep in contact with me.","exampleCn":"和我保持联系。","category":"四级"},{"id":"en_135","word":"contain","phonetic":"/kənˈteɪn/","meaning":"v. 包含；容纳","example":"The box contains books.","exampleCn":"盒子里装着书。","category":"四级"},{"id":"en_136","word":"content","phonetic":"/ˈkɒntent/","meaning":"n. 内容 adj. 满足的","example":"The content is useful.","exampleCn":"内容很有用。","category":"四级"},{"id":"en_137","word":"contest","phonetic":"/ˈkɒntest/","meaning":"n. 比赛 v. 争夺","example":"She entered the speech contest.","exampleCn":"她参加了演讲比赛。","category":"四级"},{"id":"en_138","word":"continue","phonetic":"/kənˈtɪnjuː/","meaning":"v. 继续","example":"Please continue reading.","exampleCn":"请继续读。","category":"四级"},{"id":"en_139","word":"contract","phonetic":"/ˈkɒntrækt/","meaning":"n. 合同 v. 收缩","example":"They signed a contract.","exampleCn":"他们签了合同。","category":"六级"},{"id":"en_140","word":"contrast","phonetic":"/ˈkɒntrɑːst/","meaning":"n./v. 对比；差异","example":"In contrast, sales rose.","exampleCn":"相比之下，销量上升了。","category":"六级"},{"id":"en_141","word":"contribute","phonetic":"/kənˈtrɪbjuːt/","meaning":"v. 贡献；促成","example":"Everyone contributed to the project.","exampleCn":"每个人都为项目做了贡献。","category":"六级"},{"id":"en_142","word":"convenient","phonetic":"/kənˈviːniənt/","meaning":"adj. 方便的","example":"Online shopping is convenient.","exampleCn":"网购很方便。","category":"四级"},{"id":"en_143","word":"convey","phonetic":"/kənˈveɪ/","meaning":"v. 传达；运送","example":"Words cannot convey my feelings.","exampleCn":"言语无法表达我的感受。","category":"考研"},{"id":"en_144","word":"convince","phonetic":"/kənˈvɪns/","meaning":"v. 说服；使确信","example":"I convinced him to stay.","exampleCn":"我说服他留下。","category":"六级"},{"id":"en_145","word":"cooperate","phonetic":"/kəʊˈɒpəreɪt/","meaning":"v. 合作","example":"We should cooperate with each other.","exampleCn":"我们应相互合作。","category":"六级"},{"id":"en_146","word":"cope","phonetic":"/kəʊp/","meaning":"v. 应对；处理","example":"He can cope with pressure.","exampleCn":"他能应对压力。","category":"考研"},{"id":"en_147","word":"copy","phonetic":"/ˈkɒpi/","meaning":"v./n. 复制；副本","example":"Please copy this file.","exampleCn":"请复制这个文件。","category":"四级"},{"id":"en_148","word":"correct","phonetic":"/kəˈrekt/","meaning":"adj. 正确的 v. 改正","example":"Your answer is correct.","exampleCn":"你的答案是正确的。","category":"四级"},{"id":"en_149","word":"cost","phonetic":"/kɒst/","meaning":"n. 成本 v. 花费","example":"The cost is too high.","exampleCn":"成本太高了。","category":"四级"},{"id":"en_150","word":"courage","phonetic":"/ˈkʌrɪdʒ/","meaning":"n. 勇气","example":"He showed great courage.","exampleCn":"他表现出极大勇气。","category":"四级"},{"id":