Our team defeated theirs.","exampleCn":"我们队击败了他们队。","category":"四级"},{"id":"en_164","word":"defend","phonetic":"/dɪˈfend/","meaning":"v. 防御；辩护","example":"He defended his decision.","exampleCn":"他为他的决定辩护。","category":"六级"},{"id":"en_165","word":"define","phonetic":"/dɪˈfaɪn/","meaning":"v. 定义；界定","example":"Can you define this term?","exampleCn":"你能定义这个术语吗？","category":"六级"},{"id":"en_166","word":"degree","phonetic":"/dɪˈɡriː/","meaning":"n. 程度；学位","example":"She has a degree in history.","exampleCn":"她有历史学学位。","category":"四级"},{"id":"en_167","word":"delay","phonetic":"/dɪˈleɪ/","meaning":"v./n. 延迟；推迟","example":"The flight was delayed.","exampleCn":"航班延误了。","category":"四级"},{"id":"en_168","word":"deliver","phonetic":"/dɪˈlɪvə(r)/","meaning":"v. 递送；发表","example":"We deliver within 24 hours.","exampleCn":"我们24小时内送达。","category":"四级"},{"id":"en_169","word":"demand","phonetic":"/dɪˈmɑːnd/","meaning":"n./v. 需求；要求","example":"There is a high demand for nurses.","exampleCn":"护士需求量大。","category":"六级"},{"id":"en_170","word":"demonstrate","phonetic":"/ˈdemənstreɪt/","meaning":"v. 演示；证明","example":"He demonstrated how to use it.","exampleCn":"他演示了如何使用。","category":"考研"},{"id":"en_171","word":"deny","phonetic":"/dɪˈnaɪ/","meaning":"v. 否认；拒绝","example":"He denied the accusation.","exampleCn":"他否认了指控。","category":"六级"},{"id":"en_172","word":"depend","phonetic":"/dɪˈpend/","meaning":"v. 依靠；取决于","example":"It depends on the weather.","exampleCn":"这取决于天气。","category":"四级"},{"id":"en_173","word":"describe","phonetic":"/dɪˈskraɪb/","meaning":"v. 描述","example":"Describe what you saw.","exampleCn":"描述你看到的一切。","category":"四级"},{"id":"en_174","word":"desert","phonetic":"/dɪˈzɜːt/","meaning":"n. 沙漠 v. 抛弃","example":"They crossed the desert.","exampleCn":"他们穿越了沙漠。","category":"四级"},{"id":"en_175","word":"deserve","phonetic":"/dɪˈzɜːv/","meaning":"v. 应得；值得","example":"He deserves a reward.","exampleCn":"他应得一份奖励。","category":"六级"},{"id":"en_176","word":"design","phonetic":"/dɪˈzaɪn/","meaning":"n./v. 设计","example":"This is a clever design.","exampleCn":"这是个巧妙的设计。","category":"四级"},{"id":"en_177","word":"desire","phonetic":"/dɪˈzaɪə(r)/","meaning":"n./v. 渴望","example":"She has a strong desire to succeed.","exampleCn":"她有强烈的成功欲望。","category":"六级"},{"id":"en_178","word":"destroy","phonetic":"/dɪˈstrɔɪ/","meaning":"v. 破坏；摧毁","example":"The fire destroyed the building.","exampleCn":"大火摧毁了建筑。","category":"四级"},{"id":"en_179","word":"detail","phonetic":"/ˈdiːteɪl/","meaning":"n. 细节","example":"Please give me more details.","exampleCn":"请给我更多细节。","category":"四级"},{"id":"en_180","word":"detect","phonetic":"/dɪˈtekt/","meaning":"v. 发现；探测","example":"The device detects smoke.","exampleCn":"这个装置探测烟雾。","category":"六级"},{"id":"en_181","word":"determine","phonetic":"/dɪˈtɜːmɪn/","meaning":"v. 决定；确定","example":"We must determine the cause.","exampleCn":"我们必须查明原因。","category":"六级"},{"id":"en_182","word":"develop","phonetic":"/dɪˈveləp/","meaning":"v. 发展；开发","example":"The company develops new software.","exampleCn":"公司开发新软件。","category":"四级"},{"id":"en_183","word":"devote","phonetic":"/dɪˈvəʊt/","meaning":"v. 致力于；奉献","example":"She devoted her life to teaching.","exampleCn":"她把一生奉献给教学。","category":"考研"},{"id":"en_184","word":"differ","phonetic":"/ˈdɪfə(r)/","meaning":"v. 不同；相异","example":"Opinions differ on this issue.","exampleCn":"对此问题意见不一。","category":"四级"},{"id":"en_185","word":"different","phonetic":"/ˈdɪfrənt/","meaning":"adj. 不同的","example":"We have different ideas.","exampleCn":"我们想法不同。","category":"四级"},{"id":"en_186","word":"difficult","phonetic":"/ˈdɪfɪkəlt/","meaning":"adj. 困难的","example":"This is a difficult question.","exampleCn":"这是个难题。","category":"四级"},{"id":"en_187","word":"direct","phonetic":"/dəˈrekt/","meaning":"adj. 直接的 v. 指导","example":"Give me a direct answer.","exampleCn":"直接回答我。","category":"四级"},{"id":"en_188","word":"disagree","phonetic":"/ˌdɪsəˈɡriː/","meaning":"v. 不同意","example":"I disagree with your plan.","exampleCn":"我不同意你的计划。","category":"四级"},{"id":"en_189","word":"disappear","phonetic":"/ˌdɪsəˈpɪə(r)/","meaning":"v. 消失","example":"The sun disappeared behind the clouds.","exampleCn":"太阳消失在云后。","category":"四级"},{"id":"en_190","word":"discover","phonetic":"/dɪˈskʌvə(r)/","meaning":"v. 发现","example":"Scientists discovered a new species.","exampleCn":"科学家发现了新物种。","category":"四级"},{"id":"en_191","word":"discuss","phonetic":"/dɪˈskʌs/","meaning":"v. 讨论","example":"Let's discuss the problem.","exampleCn":"我们讨论一下这个问题。","category":"四级"},{"id":"en_192","word":"disease","phonetic":"/dɪˈziːz/","meaning":"n. 疾病","example":"He suffers from a rare disease.","exampleCn":"他患有一种罕见疾病。","category":"六级"},{"id":"en_193","word":"display","phonetic":"/dɪˈspleɪ/","meaning":"v./n. 展示；显示","example":"The results are displayed on screen.","exampleCn":"结果显示在屏幕上。","category":"四级"},{"id":"en_194","word":"distance","phonetic":"/ˈdɪstəns/","meaning":"n. 距离","example":"The town is within walking distance.","exampleCn":"小镇在步行距离内。","category":"四级"},{"id":"en_195","word":"divide","phonetic":"/dɪˈvaɪd/","meaning":"v. 分开；划分","example":"Divide the class into groups.","exampleCn":"把班级分成小组。","category":"四级"},{"id":"en_196","word":"doctor","phonetic":"/ˈdɒktə(r)/","meaning":"n. 医生；博士","example":"You should see a doctor.","exampleCn":"你该去看医生。","category":"四级"},{"id":"en_197","word":"document","phonetic":"/ˈdɒkjumənt/","meaning":"n. 文件；文档","example":"Please read the document carefully.","exampleCn":"请仔细阅读文件。","category":"四级"},{"id":"en_198","word":"domestic","phonetic":"/dəˈmestɪk/","meaning":"adj. 国内的；家庭的","example":"Domestic demand is growing.","exampleCn":"国内需求在增长。","category":"考研"},{"id":"en_199","word":"dominate","phonetic":"/ˈdɒmɪneɪt/","meaning":"v. 支配；主导","example":"A few firms dominate the market.","exampleCn":"少数公司主导市场。","category":"考研"},{"id":"en_200","word":"double","phonetic":"/ˈdʌbl/","meaning":"adj. 两倍的 v. 使加倍","example":"The number doubled in a year.","exampleCn":"数量一年内翻了一番。","category":"四级"},{"id":"en_201","word":"doubt","phonetic":"/daʊt/","meaning":"n./v. 怀疑","example":"I have no doubt about it.","exampleCn":"我对此毫不怀疑。","category":"四级"},{"id":"en_202","word":"draft","phonetic":"/drɑːft/","meaning":"n. 草稿 v. 起草","example":"He wrote a draft of the report.","exampleCn":"他写了报告草稿。","category":"六级"},{"id":"en_203","word":"dramatic","phonetic":"/drəˈmætɪk/","meaning":"adj. 显著的；戏剧性的","example":"There was a dramatic increase.","exampleCn":"出现了显著增长。","category":"考研"},{"id":"en_204","word":"duty","phonetic":"/ˈdjuːti/","meaning":"n. 责任；职责","example":"It's my duty to help.","exampleCn":"帮助他人是我的职责。","category":"四级"},{"id":"en_205","word":"efficient","phonetic":"/ɪˈfɪʃnt/","meaning":"adj. 高效的","example":"She is an efficient worker.","exampleCn":"她是个高效的员工。","category":"四级"},{"id":"en_206","word":"fascinate","phonetic":"/ˈfæsɪneɪt/","meaning":"v. 使着迷","example":"Space fascinates children.","exampleCn":"太空让孩子们着迷。","category":"六级"},{"id":"en_207","word":"generate","phonetic":"/ˈdʒenəreɪt/","meaning":"v. 产生；生成","example":"Solar panels generate power.","exampleCn":"太阳能板发电。","category":"六级"},{"id":"en_208","word":"hesitate","phonetic":"/ˈhezɪteɪt/","meaning":"v. 犹豫","example":"Do not hesitate to ask.","exampleCn":"有问题尽管问。","category":"六级"},{"id":"en_209","word":"implement","phonetic":"/ˈɪmplɪment/","meaning":"v. 实施 n. 工具","example":"We will implement the changes.","exampleCn":"我们将实施这些改动。","category":"六级"},{"id":"en_210","word":"justify","phonetic":"/ˈdʒʌstɪfaɪ/","meaning":"v. 证明…正当","example":"How do you justify the cost?","exampleCn":"你如何证明这笔花费合理？","category":"六级"},{"id":"en_211","word":"keep","phonetic":"/kiːp/","meaning":"v. 保持；保留","example":"Keep the door closed.","exampleCn":"把门关着。","category":"四级"},{"id":"en_212","word":"launch","phonetic":"/lɔːntʃ/","meaning":"v. 发射；发起","example":"They launch a new product.","exampleCn":"他们推出了一款新产品。","category":"四级"},{"id":"en_213","word":"maintain","phonetic":"/meɪnˈteɪn/","meaning":"v. 维持；维护","example":"Maintain a healthy diet.","exampleCn":"保持健康饮食。","category":"四级"},{"id":"en_214","word":"negotiate","phonetic":"/nɪˈɡəʊʃieɪt/","meaning":"v. 谈判；协商","example":"They negotiated a deal.","exampleCn":"他们谈成了一笔交易。","category":"雅思托福"},{"id":"en_215","word":"observe","phonetic":"/əbˈzɜːv/","meaning":"v. 观察；遵守","example":"Observe the rules carefully.","exampleCn":"仔细遵守规则。","category":"雅思托福"},{"id":"en_216","word":"persuade","phonetic":"/pəˈsweɪd/","meaning":"v. 说服","example":"I persuaded him to stay.","exampleCn":"我说服他留下来。","category":"雅思托福"},{"id":"en_217","word":"reluctant","phonetic":"/rɪˈlʌktənt/","meaning":"adj. 不情愿的","example":"She was reluctant to leave.","exampleCn":"她不愿离开。","category":"雅思托福"},{"id":"en_218","word":"significant","phonetic":"/sɪɡˈnɪfɪkənt/","meaning":"adj. 显著的；重要的","example":"a significant improvement","exampleCn":"显著的进步。","category":"雅思托福"},{"id":"en_219","word":"tremendous","phonetic":"/trəˈmendəs/","meaning":"adj. 巨大的","example":"a tremendous success","exampleCn":"巨大的成功。","category":"雅思托福"},{"id":"en_220","word":"ultimate","phonetic":"/ˈʌltɪmət/","meaning":"adj. 最终的","example":"the ultimate goal","exampleCn":"最终目标。","category":"雅思托福"}],"ja":[{"id":"ja_001","word":"こんにちは","phonetic":"konnichiwa","meaning":"你好","example":"こんにちは、元気ですか。","exampleCn":"你好，还好吗？","category":"问候"},{"id":"ja_002","word":"ありがとう","phonetic":"arigatou","meaning":"谢谢","example":"ありがとうございました。","exampleCn":"非常感谢。","category":"问候"}]},"sentences":{"en":[{"id":"s001","text":"Could you help me with this, please?","cn":"你能帮我一下吗？","scene":"日常求助","level":"A2"},{"id":"s002","text":"I would like a cup of coffee, please.","cn":"我想要一杯咖啡。","scene":"点餐","level":"A1"},{"id":"s003","text":"Excuse me, how can I get to the nearest station?","cn":"打扰一下，最近的车站怎么走？","scene":"问路","level":"A2"},{"id":"s004","text":"Nice to meet you. My name is Li Ming.","cn":"很高兴认识你，我叫李明。","scene":"自我介绍","level":"A1"},{"id":"s005","text":"I am really looking forward to the weekend.","cn":"我非常期待周末。","scene":"日常闲聊","level":"B1"},{"id":"s006","text":"Sorry, I did not catch that. Could you say it again?","cn":"抱歉，我没听清，能再说一遍吗？","scene":"沟通澄清","level":"A2"},{"id":"s007","text":"It is a great idea, but I have a small concern.","cn":"这是个好主意，但我有点小顾虑。","scene":"表达观点","level":"B1"},{"id":"s008","text":"Thank you so much for your help today.","cn":"非常感谢你今天的帮助。","scene":"表达感谢","level":"A2"},{"id":"s009","text":"I usually go jogging in the early morning.","cn":"我通常一大早去慢跑。","scene":"生活习惯","level":"A2"},{"id":"s010","text":"Let us discuss the details after lunch.","cn":"我们午饭后讨论细节吧。","scene":"工作沟通","level":"B1"},{"id":"s011","text":"The weather is lovely today, is not it?","cn":"今天天气真好，不是吗？","scene":"日常闲聊","level":"A2"},{"id":"s012","text":"I am afraid I cannot make it on time.","cn":"恐怕我没法准时到了。","scene":"沟通澄清","level":"B1"},{"id":"s013","text":"Could I have the bill, please?","cn":"可以给我账单吗？","scene":"点餐","level":"A1"},{"id":"s014","text":"This is the best movie I have seen this year.","cn":"这是我今年看过最好的电影。","scene":"日常闲聊","level":"B1"},{"id":"s015","text":"Can you recommend a good place to visit here?","cn":"你能推荐这里一个好玩的地方吗？","scene":"日常求助","level":"B1"},{"id":"s016","text":"I completely understand how you feel.","cn":"我完全理解你的感受。","scene":"表达观点","level":"B1"},{"id":"s017","text":"Please let me know if you need anything else.","cn":"如果还需要别的请告诉我。","scene":"工作沟通","level":"B1"},{"id":"s018","text":"I would rather stay in and read a book.","cn":"我更想待在家里看书。","scene":"生活习惯","level":"B1"},{"id":"s019","text":"Hold on a second, I will be right back.","cn":"稍等一下，我马上回来。","scene":"日常求助","level":"A2"},{"id":"s020","text":"That sounds wonderful. Count me in!","cn":"听起来太棒了，算我一个！","scene":"日常闲聊","level":"A2"},{"id":"s021","text":"My name is Wang Lin. Nice to meet you.","cn":"我叫王林，很高兴认识你。","scene":"自我介绍","level":"A1"},{"id":"s022","text":"I would like to book a table for two.","cn":"我想订一张两人桌。","scene":"点餐","level":"A2"},{"id":"s023","text":"Where is the nearest subway station?","cn":"最近的地铁站在哪里？","scene":"问路","level":"A1"},{"id":"s024","text":"Turn left at the traffic lights.","cn":"在红绿灯处左转。","scene":"问路","level":"A1"},{"id":"s025","text":"I get up at seven every morning.","cn":"我每天早上七点起床。","scene":"生活习惯","level":"A1"},{"id":"s026","text":"Could you speak a little more slowly?","cn":"你能说慢一点吗？","scene":"沟通澄清","level":"A2"},{"id":"s027","text":"I think this plan needs more time.","cn":"我觉得这个计划需要更多时间。","scene":"表达观点","level":"B1"},{"id":"s028","text":"I really appreciate your help with this.","cn":"非常感谢你在这件事上的帮助。","scene":"表达感谢","level":"B2"},{"id":"s029","text":"Let me get back to you on that tomorrow.","cn":"这件事我明天再答复你。","scene":"工作沟通","level":"B2"},{"id":"s030","text":"I have been learning English for three years.","cn":"我学英语已经三年了。","scene":"自我介绍","level":"B1"},{"id":"s031","text":"Would you mind opening the window?","cn":"你介意开一下窗吗？","scene":"日常求助","level":"B1"},{"id":"s032","text":"The train leaves at half past eight.","cn":"火车八点半出发。","scene":"出行","level":"A1"},{"id":"s033","text":"I am sorry, but I have to cancel our meeting.","cn":"很抱歉，我得取消我们的会议。","scene":"工作沟通","level":"B2"},{"id":"s034","text":"This soup tastes a bit too salty to me.","cn":"我觉得这汤有点太咸了。","scene":"点餐","level":"A2"},{"id":"s035","text":"I often listen to music while working.","cn":"我经常边工作边听音乐。","scene":"生活习惯","level":"B1"},{"id":"s036","text":"Could you tell me where the restroom is?","cn":"你能告诉我洗手间在哪里吗？","scene":"问路","level":"A2"},{"id":"s037","text":"That is exactly what I was thinking.","cn":"这正是我在想的。","scene":"表达观点","level":"B2"},{"id":"s038","text":"Please feel free to ask me any questions.","cn":"有任何问题尽管问我。","scene":"工作沟通","level":"B1"},{"id":"s039","text":"I am going to visit my grandparents this weekend.","cn":"这周末我打算去看望祖父母。","scene":"日常闲聊","level":"A2"},{"id":"s040","text":"Thanks for letting me know. I will be there.","cn":"谢谢你告诉我，我会去的。","scene":"表达感谢","level":"B1"}],"ja":[{"id":"js001","text":"こんにちは、はじめまして。","cn":"你好，初次见面。","scene":"自我介绍","level":"A1"},{"id":"js002","text":"これをください。","cn":"请给我这个。","scene":"点餐","level":"A1"}]},"dialogues":{"en":[{"id":"d001","scene":"咖啡店点餐","level":"A2","lines":[{"id":"d001_1","role":"店员","text":"Good morning! What can I get for you?","cn":"早上好！您需要点什么？"},{"id":"d001_2","role":"顾客","text":"I would like a medium latte, please.","cn":"我想要一杯中杯拿铁。"},{"id":"d001_3","role":"店员","text":"Would you like anything else?","cn":"还需要别的吗？"},{"id":"d001_4","role":"顾客","text":"No, thank you. That is all.","cn":"不用了，谢谢，就这些。"}]},{"id":"d002","scene":"问路","level":"A2","lines":[{"id":"d002_1","role":"游客","text":"Excuse me, is this the way to the city museum?","cn":"打扰一下，这是去市博物馆的路吗？"},{"id":"d002_2","role":"路人","text":"Yes, just go straight for two blocks.","cn":"是的，直走两个街区就到。"},{"id":"d002_3","role":"游客","text":"Thank you very much!","cn":"非常感谢！"}]},{"id":"d003","scene":"初次见面","level":"A2","lines":[{"id":"d003_1","role":"A","text":"Hi, I do not think we have met. I am Wang Lin.","cn":"你好，我们好像没见过，我叫王林。"},{"id":"d003_2","role":"B","text":"Nice to meet you, I am Emma.","cn":"很高兴认识你，我是艾玛。"},{"id":"d003_3","role":"A","text":"Nice to meet you too. Where are you from?","cn":"我也很高兴认识你，你来自哪里？"}]},{"id":"d004","scene":"约会时间","level":"B1","lines":[{"id":"d004_1","role":"A","text":"Are we still on for dinner tomorrow?","cn":"我们明天晚饭还照常吗？"},{"id":"d004_2","role":"B","text":"Yes, but can we make it seven instead?","cn":"照常，不过能改到七点吗？"},{"id":"d004_3","role":"A","text":"Sure, seven works for me.","cn":"当然，七点我可以。"}]},{"id":"d005","scene":"购物退货","level":"B1","lines":[{"id":"d005_1","role":"顾客","text":"Hello, I would like to return this item.","cn":"你好，我想退这件商品。"},{"id":"d005_2","role":"店员","text":"Do you have the receipt with you?","cn":"您带收据了吗？"},{"id":"d005_3","role":"顾客","text":"Yes, here it is.","cn":"带了，给你。"}]},{"id":"d006","scene":"机场值机","level":"B1","lines":[{"id":"d006_1","role":"旅客","text":"Good afternoon. I would like to check in for flight CA123.","cn":"下午好，我想办理 CA123 航班的值机。"},{"id":"d006_2","role":"地勤","text":"May I see your passport, please?","cn":"可以看一下您的护照吗？"},{"id":"d006_3","role":"旅客","text":"Here you are. I have one bag to check.","cn":"给你。我有一件行李要托运。"},{"id":"d006_4","role":"地勤","text":"Thank you. Your seat is 24A, boarding at 9:40.","cn":"谢谢。您的座位是 24A，9:40 登机。"}]},{"id":"d007","scene":"看医生","level":"B2","lines":[{"id":"d007_1","role":"医生","text":"What seems to be the problem today?","cn":"今天哪里不舒服？"},{"id":"d007_2","role":"患者","text":"I have had a headache since yesterday evening.","cn":"我从昨天晚上开始头疼。"},{"id":"d007_3","role":"医生","text":"Do you have any other symptoms, like a fever?","cn":"还有其他症状吗，比如发烧？"},{"id":"d007_4","role":"患者","text":"No, just the headache. It is getting worse.","cn":"没有，只是头疼，而且越来越严重。"}]},{"id":"d008","scene":"电话预约","level":"B2","lines":[{"id":"d008_1","role":"接待员","text":"Good morning, how may I help you?","cn":"早上好，有什么可以帮您？"},{"id":"d008_2","role":"来电者","text":"I would like to make an appointment with Dr. Smith.","cn":"我想约史密斯医生。"},{"id":"d008_3","role":"接待员","text":"Would Thursday afternoon at three work for you?","cn":"周四下午三点您方便吗？"},{"id":"d008_4","role":"来电者","text":"That would be perfect. Thank you.","cn":"那太好了，谢谢。"}]}],"ja":[]}}